    "title": "Shell：统计行数、单词数与字节数",
    "stem_markdown": "## 题目\n\n用 bash 写一个过滤器：读入标准输入的全部文本，输出它的行数、单词数与字节数。\n\n### 输入\n\n标准输入中的任意文本，可能为空，也可能不以换行结尾。\n\n### 输出\n\n一行，三个用单个空格分隔的整数，依次为：\n\n1. 行数：输入中换行符的个数（结尾没有换行符的那一小段文本不计为一行）；\n2. 单词数：被空白字符（空格、制表符、换行）分隔出的非空片段个数；\n3. 字节数：输入的总字节数。\n\n输出末尾有一个换行。\n\n### 示例\n\n输入：\n\n```\nthe quick brown fox\njumps over the lazy dog\n```\n\n输出：\n\n```\n2 9 44\n```\n\n（两个换行符；9 个空白分隔的单词；两行文字加换行共 44 字节。）\n",
    "language": "bash",
    "reference_answer": "#!/usr/bin/env bash\nset -euo pipefail\n\nread -r lines words bytes < <(LC_ALL=C wc -l -w -c)\nprintf '%s %s %s\\n' \"$lines\" \"$words\" \"$bytes\"\n",
    "adapter": {
      "kind": "stdin",
      "args": [],
      "stdin": "the quick brown fox\njumps over the lazy dog\n",
      "expect_exit_code": 0,
      "comparison": {
        "stdout": "ignore_trailing_whitespace",
        "stderr": "ignored",
        "numeric_tolerance": null
      }
    },
    "cases": [
      {
        "name": "示例：两行文本",
        "ordinal": 0,
        "weight": 1,
        "visible_to_student": true,
        "stdin": "the quick brown fox\njumps over the lazy dog\n",
        "args": [],
        "expected_stdout": "2 9 44\n",
        "expected_stderr": null,
        "expected_exit_code": 0
      },
      {
        "name": "隐藏：空输入",
        "ordinal": 1,
        "weight": 1,
        "visible_to_student": false,
        "stdin": "",
        "args": [],
        "expected_stdout": "0 0 0\n",
        "expected_stderr": null,
        "expected_exit_code": 0
      },
      {
        "name": "隐藏：单行",
        "ordinal": 2,
        "weight": 1,
        "visible_to_student": false,
        "stdin": "one\n",
        "args": [],
        "expected_stdout": "1 1 4\n",
        "expected_stderr": null,
        "expected_exit_code": 0
      },
