    "title": "Shell：出现次数最多的行",
    "stem_markdown": "## 题目\n\n读取标准输入，找出出现次数最多的那一行，只输出该行的内容。\n\n### 输入\n\n每行是一个非空且不含空白的单词；输入至少有 1 行。\n\n### 输出\n\n出现次数最多的那一行本身（不带次数），末尾换行。若有多行并列最多，输出按字节序（`LC_ALL=C` 的字典序）最小的那一行。\n\n### 示例\n\n输入：\n\n```\napple\nbanana\napple\ncherry\napple\nbanana\n```\n\n输出：\n\n```\napple\n```\n",
    "language": "bash",
    "reference_answer": "#!/usr/bin/env bash\nset -euo pipefail\n\nLC_ALL=C sort \\\n  | LC_ALL=C uniq -c \\\n  | LC_ALL=C sort -k1,1nr -k2,2 \\\n  | LC_ALL=C awk 'NR == 1 { top = $0 } END { sub(/^ *[0-9]+ /, \"\", top); print top }'\n",
    "adapter": {
      "kind": "stdin",
      "args": [],
      "stdin": "apple\nbanana\napple\ncherry\napple\nbanana\n",
      "expect_exit_code": 0,
      "comparison": {
